  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "食堂",
    "id": "61",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（あぁもう、ムシャクシャする！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（何なのよ！　みんなしてあたしが悪者っていうか、空気読めないみたいに言ってさ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（仕方ないじゃないの、気に食わないんだから！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（そもそも品行方正な優等生であるあたしが、何で『問題児クラス』なのよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（書類とかにミスがあったのよ、あるいは教師が寝惚けてまちがえたのよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（馴染めないのも仕方ないじゃない、仲良くできないのも！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（あたしは悪くない、周りの連中がおかしいのよ！　そうよ、あたしって不幸だわ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（それでも我慢して、なるべく波風立てないようにしてやってるのに！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（どいつもこいつも、あたしを無駄に苛立たせて～っ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（もうもうもうっ、怒ってたら余計にお腹がすいたわ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（いつもは、お母さまがお弁当をつくってくれるんだけど。この時期は年度末だから、お仕事が忙しいみたい。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（仕方ないから食堂を利用してやるわっ、感謝しなさいよね！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まだ食券は売り切れてないわよね、えぇ～っと？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（何を食べようかしら。ストレス発散にドカ食いしてやるっ、いつもは健康的な食生活を心がけてるけど！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（無駄にお肉がついたら、バレー部の活動にも支障をきたすし！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（そうよ、そういうふうに真面目に！　前向きに努力してっ、清く正しく生きてきたのに！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（神さまは不公平だわっ、何で誰もあたしのことを評価しないし報いてくれないのよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（うう。お腹がすいてるせいか、切なくなってきちゃった……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（ちょっと貧血っぽいし、レバーとかホウレン草とか摂取すべきよね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（レバニラとかにしようかしら、わりと券売機の高い位置にボタンがあるわね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（でも踏み台を使うと負けた気がするし、背伸びして……。よいしょっ、と！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「……わっ？　びっくりした！　ちょっと、あんた後ろから手ぇ伸ばさないでよ転校生！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「不躾よっ、気軽に密着してんじゃないわよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ていうか、あたしの番なのに！　割りこんでんじゃないわよ、ちょっとぐらい待てないわけっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あっ、代わりに券売機のボタン押してくれたのね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あ、ありがと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「べつにいいけどさ。あんた親切にするならするで、もうすこし何か恩着せがましいこと言いなさいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「その権利があるんだからっ、褒めたり感謝するタイミングが掴めないでしょ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ぜったい損してるわよ、無駄に毎日ドタバタと走り回ってさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ひとのお手伝いしてさ、あんたに何か得があるわけ？　誰も見てないところでもさっ、意味わかんない！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まぁ……。そんなあんただから、日頃の感謝をこめてみんなが『生徒会長』に選んだのかもね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あたしも『選別の儀』のとき、まりあ経由だけどあんたに腕章あげたのよっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「感謝しなさいよね、ふふん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんた、日頃はあんまり食堂で見かけないけど。今日は、お弁当忘れたの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ふぅん、『新生徒会』が美術室で活動してるのね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「それで他の女の子がなぜか着替え始めちゃったから、慌てて出てきたって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「お弁当も美術室に置いたままだけど、お腹がすいたから仕方なく……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そういう事情なのね、あんたも大変ね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「つうか。あんた生徒会長になったのに、前より忙しそうっていうか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんまり報われてないわよね、苦労が増えただけじゃないの？　そのうち、過労で倒れるわよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まぁいいけど。あんた、どの料理にするわけ？　カレー？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「この食堂のってけっこう大盛りよ、昼からガッツリ食べるのね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あたし、食券もって料理をとってくるからさ。あんた、あたしのぶんも席を確保しといてよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「遅い時間だし人混みがすごいけど、立ち食いになっちゃうのは嫌だから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「空いてる席を探して、料理をもってウロウロしたくないしね……。よろしくね、わかったなら返事！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「よし。じゃあ行け、ゴーゴー♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（ふふん、転校生は素直でいいわね。みんなが、こんなふうに従順だったらよかったのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（さてと。食券もって、料理を……。あれっ、そういえばあたし、保健室で寝ててお財布とかもってないのに。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（どうして、食券が買えたのかしら？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まさか、転校生がさりげなく券売機にお金いれてたの？　あたしのぶんまで、買ってくれたわけ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（うわっ、気づかなかった……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（あの馬鹿！　何でそういうことするのよっ、やっぱり一言もなく！　何なのよ、ジェントルマンなのっ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（あいつに何の得があるっていうのよ、意味わかんない！　もうもうもうっ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まさか、あたしのことが好きだから親切にしてくれたとか……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（いやいやいや。あいつは、誰に対してもこうなのよ。そうよ、勘違いしちゃ駄目よ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まったくもう。やめてよね、あんまり優しくされるのに慣れてないんだから）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（でも何だか、ちょっとだけ苛立ちが消えたわ。心が、軽くなった……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（こんなに晴れ晴れとした気持ちになれたの、いつ以来かしら）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（感謝してあげるっ、転校生♪）"
